{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X少数段落的感受短语连续堆叠，整体连贯阅读的顺滑度不如Y；但小字层级和分时出现缓解了同时扫读的负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】把每段叙事的关键落点直接凸显出来，观众即使边听边扫，也容易抓住人物当下的矛盾和心理变化；分时出现的感受词又能把音乐中的力度、节奏、动作和情绪转折具体对应起来。Y的左右栏更整齐，叙事句子也更顺畅，但部分感受被压缩成概括性标签，而且S09弱化了人物甚至愿意重新承受那些委屈的尖锐矛盾。整体而言，X不仅更容易抓住情节要点，也更能让人听见人物内心反复、细腻而矛盾的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a093d864-4448-4da1-9065-a0015d1457f3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005434005012Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:55:38.282912+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b0cfcc83734a92863a60849c9d01ba07d2987a5860f53a8bc876d242aefed325", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w